{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xZVeeGgmWyZcv5_lWvszpw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:38.495580+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xZVeeGgmWyZcv5_lWvszpw","html":"<div><h1><section><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/5E5ZbFhYxCwo4iaiaC8CwPmThDiaoyUWXceF203vAPehTlhLk8Sth7FmEFwSMBXjGswico8FXyOYicgGAuBDV3bAd1w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910Y7BGibWib1lZVdWTvJbj4Mgs0LdeR6YDd5z6IVM0CmyuaM5uoNDQszWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>为促进2026届优秀本科生全面了解口腔医学领域，激励学生继续进行医学探索，口腔医学院拟于2025年暑期举办“安徽医科大学口腔医学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动。</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>现面向全国高校招收营员20名</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>。欢迎有意报考我院的考生踊跃报名参加本次活动。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910jmhRD0446gicdnvf94vxfqh0LnAMA3ReUCf1hSxx8dAhQVAHCkOrnyw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910iaXCFpqlUHV4fnbRmgXiaOTT3g0r4Vic3zKH7B5yJaPR0uwpO4qoABkfg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>单位简介：</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>安徽医科大学口腔医学院是安徽省培养口腔医学专业高级人才的重要基地，已形成本科、研究生、博士生完整人才培养体系。1984年建系，同年开始招收口腔医学本科专业学生，2001年获口腔临床医学硕士学位授予权，2008年口腔临床医学被遴选为省级重点学科，2019年获批临床口腔医学博士点，2020年口腔医学专业入选国家级一流本科建设点，2021年与上海交通大学医学院附属第九人民医院签署教学战略合作协议。拥有省部共建实验室和安徽省口腔疾病研究省级重点实验室，是安徽省口腔医学专业综合改革试点、口腔医学卓越口腔医师培养计划单位及住院医师规范化培训口腔专业组长单位。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910T9HpC1ZYINVcRnWKVWPRrepyImPat0Bm3UGcfGpbdJiabMvXYXHa8sQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名时间：</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>口腔医学院拟于2025年8月上旬举办活动，即日起至7月31日，拟参加学生可通过电子邮件提交申请材料，逾期不再受理。审核后，确定入营人员。（具体时间及活动安排参见后续通知）</span></span></span></p><section><span></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910T9HpC1ZYINVcRnWKVWPRrepyImPat0Bm3UGcfGpbdJiabMvXYXHa8sQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>计划营员人数：</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>拟招收20名营员，实际入营人数将根据报名情况适当调整。</span></span></span></p><section><span></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910T9HpC1ZYINVcRnWKVWPRrepyImPat0Bm3UGcfGpbdJiabMvXYXHa8sQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营活动安排：</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>第一天下午：报到；开营仪式、相关介绍；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第二天全天：学术创新论坛；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第三天上午：学校、学院参观；课题组导师面对面、优秀学长学姐介绍；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第三天下午：营员考核、闭营仪式、离营。</span></span></span></p><section><span></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910T9HpC1ZYINVcRnWKVWPRrepyImPat0Bm3UGcfGpbdJiabMvXYXHa8sQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>05</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请条件：</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1．拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2．普通高校全日制本科2026届应届毕业生，且有意报考我院2026年硕士研究生的同学；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3．学习成绩优秀；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4．对科研工作有浓厚兴趣，有相关科研经历，并具有较强或潜在的研究能力；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5．英语水平满足下列条件之一：CET-6≥425分；CET-4≥500分；雅思≥5.5分；或其他外语成绩相当水平。</span></span></span></p><section><span></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910T9HpC1ZYINVcRnWKVWPRrepyImPat0Bm3UGcfGpbdJiabMvXYXHa8sQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>06</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请程序：</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1．申请表（医院官网“下载中心”或“通知公告”栏获取）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2．本科历年成绩单（加盖教务处公章）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3．英语水平的证明材料：全国大学生英语四、六级考试成绩单或相关证书；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4．其他相关能力的证明材料（如发表论文、专利、各类获奖证书等）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5．本人有效期内的身份证和学生证。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>请申请人将上述申请材料按顺序扫描合并成一个PDF文件，命名为“夏令营+目前在读的学校名称+个人姓名”，发送至邮箱：aykqkyb@126.com，逾期不再受理。报名材料经过审核通过后将以正式邮件进行通知，并加入夏令营QQ群。</span></span></span></p><section><span></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910T9HpC1ZYINVcRnWKVWPRrepyImPat0Bm3UGcfGpbdJiabMvXYXHa8sQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>07</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>学生食宿及资助安排：</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>为入选营员提供夏令营期间的免费餐宿(合肥高校或家在合肥的学生不安排住宿)，并报销学校所在城市(或家庭所在城市)至合肥的长途汽车座票(正式车票)、高铁/动车二等座(卧铺、飞机票不予报销)的往返实付路费（上限500元）。</span></span></span></p><section><span></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910T9HpC1ZYINVcRnWKVWPRrepyImPat0Bm3UGcfGpbdJiabMvXYXHa8sQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>08</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>注意事项：</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1. 本次夏令营活动不收取任何费用，口腔医学院不承担参加者活动期间所产生的任何法律和经济责任；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.营员报到时需携带身份证、学生证。在营期间，营员必须遵守安徽医科大学的相关规定；任何弄虚作假、违反学术道德行为一经发现，我院将取消其一切录取资格；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3. 表现优异者报考2026年安徽医科大学口腔医学院硕士研究生，且达到报考专业初试和复试相关要求，同等条件下可优先拟录取。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4. 口腔医学院网址:</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>http://ahskqyy.ahmu.edu.cn/index.aspx</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>研究生导师简介：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>http://ahskqyy.ahmu.edu.cn/list_277.aspx</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系方式：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系人：郑老师 张老师 黄老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系电话：0551-65161186</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地址：安徽省合肥市蜀山区梅山路81号安徽医科大学健行楼五楼科研与研究生管理办公室</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xZVeeGgmWyZcv5_lWvszpw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span></span></a></span></span></p><section><span></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/5E5ZbFhYxCxd44LIaBDicY5pHibzCp9910T9HpC1ZYINVcRnWKVWPRrepyImPat0Bm3UGcfGpbdJiabMvXYXHa8sQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></h1><p><span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑：杜欣</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>审核</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span>胡鹏</span></span></span><span><span> 耿思雅</span></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/5E5ZbFhYxCzxjgnibfGic5ekh3sTL5kIXVZtdwyNgzQan5jrapcXr9CObckicaeic41xxGVvEGrC1zvkjhzHVOIXUg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2fdc5555bb88104c084005dd610965046e56cb6c85e7fef16c8a5a313adc1cdc","textLength":1541,"sourceSha256":"8c2163d1d4d3b696178f488b5179871ffcc063ffe81c17de96050c73de2f7a73","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-39729a35e4512e6912d3","title":"2025年安徽医科大学口腔医学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营招生通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:38.495580+00:00"}
